  ],
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the sum of the series&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are co-prime, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is&nbsp;equal to ________.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>Series&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, series will be:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now using infinite&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>&nbsp;formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
